# Free Alternatives to Google Maps API

## 🎉 Good News: Mock Service Now Available!

I've added a **mock Google Maps service** to your project that works without any API key! It includes predefined data for popular destinations like Paris, Tokyo, New York, London, Dubai, Bangkok, and more.

### How to Use Mock Service

**Already configured!** Just restart your app and it will automatically use mock data when no API key is present.

```bash
# Restart your app
uv run python app.py
```

Now you can test trip creation with these destinations:
- Paris, France
- Tokyo, Japan
- New York, USA
- London, UK
